    "title": "Volatility West Coast Pils, a Collaborative Riff on a Beloved IPA - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kendall Jones ,\n9 hours ago Chuckanut Brewery and Von Ebert Brewing collaborated to create an IPA-inspired West Coast pilsner. Almost two months ago, Chuckanut Brewery invited Portland’s Von Ebert Brewing to travel north for a collaboration project. The breweries came together at Chuckanut Brewery’s facility in Burlington, Washington, to create something special. Something volatile. Read full article",
